hypotheses.lab_test:
CPU only, on friend A's cache, exp48 tails (leaf prune + divinsert), all 199 videos, official metric.
Step A (registration, GT-free): run the MIP phase-correlation plus exact-voxel pipeline on the train zarrs. Success: it recovers >= 60 of the 65 GT-linked 44b6 pairs at the right offset, and 0 pairs are accepted in 6bba or across embryos. Report any extra 44b6 pairs found without shared GT.
Step B (fusion): score every video.
Gate:
- 44b6 per-embryo delta >= +0.002, with a bootstrap over the 11 leak groups (CI > 0) and wins/losses counted per leak group;
- 6bba bit-identical;
- node ratio change <= +0.3%;
- division TP/FP unchanged;
- report the multiplier term separately from edge J.
Readout: the discordant-edge fix rate and break rate by class, and the chooser accuracy per class. Then one LB probe = best base + consensus. ANY change in the public score proves the public embryo has overlapping crops, because the pass is a no-op otherwise. That diagnostic is useful for finals whatever the sign.
